  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAFER Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LF and ToC which is developed by AmCross is in process of revision and encompass a separated output focusing on Migration and Displacement. The goal of the project is &quot;&#xa0;Reduce deaths, injuries, economic losses and impacts of migration by strengthening the&#xa0;capacity of the Nepal Red Cross Society to support vulnerable communities in preparing for, reducing&#xa0;risk from and responding to natural disasters and other stressors&quot;.
&#xa0;
Output 1.2 Improved socio-economic security (opportunity) of most vulnerable target individuals/communities address the impacts of migration (internal-external) and displacement even at times of disaster.</narrative>
  </description>
